<title>UK: CCBP sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>CCBP sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internaionale du Luxembourg SA, Banque et caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DES BANQUES POPULAIRES</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE  L 23.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	5.60	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	DENOMS (K) 50-250</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIP    0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
